## Activation and updates

Review and merge the complete inactive profile, documents and required workflow
configuration first. A separate activation PR changes only the profile's `enabled`
flag. Application commands remain in `workflows.json`; this quality framework does
not execute them. Profile/catalog upgrades require reviewed source and consumer
changes with a matching immutable governance workflow pin.
